*** Keywords ***
General_SiSo_Auto_UL_Time_Domain_IQ_Raw_Data_snapshot_for_eCPRI
    [Documentation]
    ...  The purpose of this test case is set Debug Trace with R&D parameters and capture IQ data form RMOD.
    ...  Snapshot is being verified an the last step to confirm IQ data capturing.
    ...
    ...  ARGS:
    ...  :param int cell_id: (Mandatory): global cell ID of tested cell, e.g.: 1
    ...  :param str internal_snapshot_path_to_l1_iq_data_file: (Mandatory) : internal snapshot path to iq data file or directory, containing all archives extensions,
    ...                                                                      without (if exist) first shanpsot part archive:
    ...                                                                      e.g.:  (for AVGL RU) BTS_L1231000889_RMOD_L_1_2011_l1low_iq_capture_thor.tar.gz/
    ...                                                                             (for AKQJ RU) BTS_1M222011926_RMOD_L_1_gandalf_logs.tar.gz/gandalf_logs/l1low_logs_made_es2/
    ...  :param list of dicts ul_nr_subcell_list: (Mandatory) : ul nr subcell list required to configure L1 IQ Data Collection, each nr subcell element should be defined
    ...                                                         as dictionary and should contain following parameters: nrcellDN and subcellId,
    ...                                                         example:
    ...                                                         [{"nrcellDN": "MRBTS-50610/NRBTS-1/NRCELL-1", "subcellId": 0}]
    ...  :param list of dicts capture_ru_list: (Mandatory) : capture ru list required to configure L1 IQ Data Collection, each ru element should be defined as dictionary
    ...                                                      and should contain following parameters: targetRMOD (str type: RMOD configuration DN),
    ...                                                                                               antennaList (list type: dict as element with following keys: "polarization" (str type: "MINUS_45"/"PLUS_45"/"PLUS_90"/"ZERO")
    ...                                                                                               and "antenna" (list type: integer array<[1,2,3]> or string array<["ANT1"], ["ANT2"]...>)
    ...                                                                                               captureActivityTimer (int type: range 1 to 12),
    ...                                                      example:
    ...                                                      [{"targetRMOD": '/MRBTS-50610/EQM-1/APEQM-1/RMOD-1',
    ...                                                        "antennaList": [{"polarization": "PLUS_45",
    ...                                                                         "antenna": [0, 4]},
    ...                                                                        {"polarization": "MINUS_45",
    ...                                                                         "antenna": [16, 20]}],
    ...                                                        "captureActivityTimer": 1}]
    ...  :param str profile: (Optional): profile which represents different capture mode, default None
    ...                                  Should used only when "capture_on_event_bb_ru" = True and sw_stream >= 'SBTS25R3'.
    ...                                  Allowed values are:
    ...                                  'UL_PROFILE_1', 'UL_PROFILE_2', 'UL_PROFILE_3', 'DL_PROFILE_1', 'UL_DL_PROFILE_1'.
    ...                                  When “capture_on_event_bb_ru” = True and “capture_on_event” = True, Event type profiles are allowed.
    ...                                  When “capture_on_event_bb_ru” = True and “capture_on_event” = False, Blind type profiles are allowed.
    ...  :param str buffer_cycle: (Optional): buffer cycle parameter required to configure L1 IQ Data Collection, defaults 1024frames
    ...  :param int capture_frame_offset: (Optional): capture frame offset parameter required to configure L1 IQ Data Collection, defaults to 0
    ...  :param str snapshot_coverage: (Optional): coverage of snapshot content, Full or Minor, defaults Full
    ...  :param str snapshot_dir_path: (Optional): defaults logs_path set in suite setup
    ...  :param str snapshot_name: (Optional): snapshot name, defaults snapshot_l1_iq_data.zip
    ...  :param int timeout: (Optional): timeout (in seconds) for configuration of IQ Data Collection and RnD Debug Parameters, defaults to 120

    [Arguments]    ${cell_id}
    ...            ${internal_snapshot_path_to_l1_iq_data_file}
    ...            ${ul_nr_subcell_list}
    ...            ${capture_ru_list}
    ...            ${profile}=${None}
    ...            ${buffer_cycle}=1024frames
    ...            ${capture_frame_offset}=0
    ...            ${snapshot_coverage}=Full
    ...            ${snapshot_dir_path}=${logs_path}
    ...            ${snapshot_name}=snapshot_l1_iq_data.zip
    ...            ${timeout}=120

    ${bts_type}=                                            hwpta_testline.get_type_of_setup
    ${connection}                                           connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    ${cell_dist_names}                                      admin_info_model.get_dist_names_for_specific_cell
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     cell_type=nr
    ...                                                     cell_id=${cell_id}

    Alarms.Allow Alarm                                      fault_id=8101
    ...                                                     fault_name=L1 IQ Data Suspicious Event
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

    Robot Log Step                                          Configuring L1 IQ Data Collection...
    Configure L1 IQ Data Collection                         connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    ...                                                     distname=${cell_dist_names["run_time"]}
    ...                                                     ul_nr_subcell_list=${ul_nr_subcell_list}
    ...                                                     capture_on_event=${True}
    ...                                                     capture_on_event_bb_ru=${True}
    ...                                                     profile=${profile}
    ...                                                     buffer_cycle=${buffer_cycle}
    ...                                                     capture_frame_offset=${capture_frame_offset}
    ...                                                     capture_ru_list=${capture_ru_list}
    ...                                                     timeout=${timeout}
    Robot Log Result                                        L1 IQ Data Collection is configured successfully.

    Robot Log Step                                          Configuring RnD Debug Parameters...
    Configure RnD Debug Parameters                          connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     timeout=${timeout}
    Robot Log Result                                        RnD Debug Parameters are configured successfully.

    Robot Log Step                                          Collecting snapshot (name: ${snapshot_name}, coverage: ${snapshot_coverage})...
    Collect snapshot with timing                            snapshot_coverage=${snapshot_coverage}
    ...                                                     snapshot_dir_path=${snapshot_dir_path}
    ...                                                     snapshot_name=${snapshot_name}
    Robot Log Result                                        Snapshothas been collected successfully into ${snapshot_dir_path}.

    Alarms.Disallow Alarm                                   fault_id=8101
    ...                                                     fault_name=L1 IQ Data Suspicious Event
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

    Robot Log Step                                          Verifing if snapshot contains correct L1 IQ Data file...
    Verify Snapshot Content                                 snapshot_dir_path=${snapshot_dir_path}
    ...                                                     snapshot_file_name=${snapshot_name}
    ...                                                     internal_snapshot_path_to_l1_iq_data_file=${internal_snapshot_path_to_l1_iq_data_file}
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

    [Teardown]                                              Run keywords
    ...                                                     Disable L1 IQ Data
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     timeout=${timeout}
    ...                                                     AND
    ...                                                     Configure RnD Debug Parameters
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     param_value=0
    ...                                                     timeout=${timeout}

Configure RnD Debug Parameters
    [Arguments]    ${connection}
    ...            ${domain_name}=NrUlPhy
    ...            ${param_name}=phyEventEnableExt
    ...            ${param_value}=2147483648
    ...            ${timeout}=120

    ${admin_result}                                         admin_info_model.set_rad_debug_parameters
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     domain_name=${domain_name}
    ...                                                     param_name=${param_name}
    ...                                                     param_value=${param_value}
    ...                                                     timeout=${timeout}

Verify Snapshot Content
    [Arguments]    ${snapshot_dir_path}
    ...            ${snapshot_file_name}
    ...            ${internal_snapshot_path_to_l1_iq_data_file}
    ...            ${bts_type}

    ${sw_version}=                                          Get Software Version
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    ${credentials}                                          connections.get_http_connection_credentials
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

    snapshot.setup_snapshot_settings
    ...                                                     snapshot_dir=${snapshot_dir_path}
    ...                                                     coverage=Full
    ...                                                     sw_version=${sw_version}
    ...                                                     connection_host=${credentials['ip']}
    ...                                                     connection_port=${credentials['port']}
    ...                                                     snapshot_file_name=${snapshot_file_name}

    ${iq_data_archive}                                      Evaluate
    ...                                                     str("""${internal_snapshot_path_to_l1_iq_data_file}""").split('/')[0]
    ${iq_data_file}                                         Evaluate
    ...                                                     str("""${internal_snapshot_path_to_l1_iq_data_file}""").split('/')[-1]
    ${snapshot_part_archive_path}                           snapshot.find_file_in_snapshot_file_list
    ...                                                     filename=${iq_data_archive}
    Should be true                                          """${snapshot_part_archive_path}"""!="""${False}"""
    ...                                                     msg= File ${iq_data_archive} not found in snapshot.
    ${snapshot_part_archive}                                Evaluate
    ...                                                     str("""${snapshot_part_archive_path}""").split('/')[0]

    Robot Log Operation                                     Extracting snapshot file...
    ${iq_data_file_extracted_dir}                           snapshot.extract_shapshot_file_based_on_internal_path
    ...                                                     internal_snapshot_path=${snapshot_part_archive}/${internal_snapshot_path_to_l1_iq_data_file}

    ${iq_data_file_path}                                    snapshot.find_and_copy_l1low_iq_capture_bin_file
    ...                                                     file_dir_path=${iq_data_file_extracted_dir}
    ...                                                     destination_dir_path=${logs_path}
    ${iq_data_file_name}                                    Evaluate
    ...                                                     str("""${iq_data_file_path}""").split('/')[-1]
    Robot Log Result                                        Extracted IQ data file has been found with name ${iq_data_file_name}.
    ...                                                     to_console=${True}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Extracted IQ data file has been copied into ${iq_data_file_path}.

    Verify Size of IQ Data File                             iq_data_file_path=${iq_data_file_path}

    [Teardown]                                              Run keywords
    ...                                                     snapshot.teardown
    ...                                                     AND
    ...                                                     snapshot.disconnect

Verify Size of IQ Data File
    [Arguments]    ${iq_data_file_path}
    ${iq_data_file_size}                                    vm.get_file_size
    ...                                                     file_path=${iq_data_file_path}
    Should be true                                          ${iq_data_file_size} > 0
    Robot Log Result                                        IQ Data file size verification succeed.
    ...                                                     to_console=${True}
